{
  "name": "dsh-qq-router",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DSH 插件：从 QQ 远程驾驶本 profile 里【已有的会话】—— 前缀路由、可查路由表、把消息注入成普通 user 轮次（UI 里看起来就是你自己发的），回复走 onebot_send。",
  "author": "deepseek",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "onebot",
    "qq",
    "remote"
  ],
  "type": "module",
